  description="The terms for using taren.se: content, product information, optional support, external links and limits of liability."
  eyebrow="Terms"
  heading="Terms of use"
  intro="These terms cover the taren.se website. Individual products may come with their own terms."
  updated="2026-11-18"
>
  <h2>About this website</h2>
  <p>
    taren.se presents the work of Taren, an independent software studio run by {SITE.founder} in {SITE.country}. By
    using the site, you agree to these terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Content and trademarks</h2>
  <p>
    Unless stated otherwise, the text, images, screenshots and design of this website are the work of {SITE.founder},
