    the website. Nothing in these terms limits rights you have under consumer law that cannot be limited.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact and changes</h2>
  <p>
    Questions are welcome through <ExternalLink href={SITE.contactUrl}>{SITE.contactLabel}</ExternalLink>. If these
    terms change, the date at the top will be updated.
  </p>
</TextPage>
